OL,3,GNEWSASmokers risking 'rat poison'
OL,4,Atobacco as illegal trade booms
OL,5,
OL,6,FIllegal tobacco, cigarettes and vapes
OL,7,Fare cheap, unregulated and, it seems,
OL,8,Fflooding the high street, sold by rogue
OL,9,Ftraders operating from corner shops and
OL,10,Fvape stores.
OL,12,FAs he lights up a roll-up on a
OL,13,FStaffordshire street with tobacco he
OL,14,Fsays was bought from a rogue trader,
OL,15,FSimon Wickes admits he has no idea what
OL,16,Fis actually in it.
OL,18,F"They're just scrapings from the floors
OL,19,Fof wherever they make these cigarettes
OL,20,Fand tobacco," he said.
